    "terrainName": "farm",
    "description": "What: the guard dog (CE-4623 AB-5; docs/designs/animals/DESIGN_Animals.md \u00a75 / \u00a79). On the farm terrain the 'Farm dog' area (a 12 x 8 m yard at (40, 108)) populates one dog ('Farm dog 1'). A three-man patrol ('Soldier 1'..'Soldier 3', Friend, default ROE) walks east along y \u2248 108 from x 0 straight through the dog's yard to x \u2248 85. The dog guards its ground: it barks at the first man inside its home + 15 m, attacks a man who comes close inside its home and bites him (8 damage), and while it attacks it is marked Dangerous \u2014 so the soldiers may fire at it in self-defence. Judge: (1) the dog barks (2) it bites a soldier (3) it is marked Dangerous (4) a soldier fires at it (self-defence) (5) no soldier fires before it is Dangerous. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh ua-animal-guard-dog"
  },
